# TypeScript Patterns

- Use `unknown` not `any` — enforced across all KNIRV TypeScript packages
- Import KNIRVBASE types from `packages/KNIRVBASE/ts/dist/lib/index.js`
- New KNIRVBASE components go in `packages/KNIRVBASE/ts/dist/components/` (auth, security, monitoring, logging)
- SDK errors extend `KnirvchainTransactionSDKError` from `packages/KNIRVSDK/ts/transaction/src/core/error.ts`
- API calls use `APIPromise<T>` from `packages/KNIRVSDK/ts/transaction/src/core/api-promise.ts`
- KNIRVARENA game components: Three.js patterns in `packages/KNIRVARENA/packages/ts_client_2/src/components/game/`
- Agent compiler output in `src/core/agent-core-compiler/build/` — each agent is a separate index.ts
- KNIRVSERVER frontend: Next.js app at `packages/KNIRVSERVER/frontend/` built to `packages/KNIRVSERVER/frontend/out/`
- Dashboard components: `packages/KNIRVSERVER/frontend/src/components/dashboard/`
- Storage: browser-side persistence via `src/core/storage/BrowserDB.ts` and `BrowserStorage.ts`
